<%- include('../partials/head', { title, csrfToken }) %>
<div class="workspace-shell"><%- include('../partials/user-topbar') %><main class="workspace-main content-area page-auto-clipping">
  <header class="page-header user-page-hero"><div class="user-page-hero__copy"><span class="eyebrow">Tools</span><h1>Auto Clipping</h1><p>Ubah video panjang jadi clip yang lebih siap tayang. Mulai dari source, pilih strategi utama, lalu atur visual dan subtitle tanpa tenggelam di field teknis.</p></div></header>
  <section class="user-page-summary-grid user-page-summary-grid--compact">
    <article class="user-page-summary-card user-page-summary-card--soft"><span>Quick mode</span><strong>Fokus ke input penting</strong><p>Cocok kalau kamu mau submit cepat tanpa membuka semua kontrol editor.</p></article>
    <article class="user-page-summary-card"><span>Advanced mode</span><strong>Brief lebih detail</strong><p>Buka field teknis hanya saat kamu memang perlu arahan yang lebih spesifik.</p></article>
    <article class="user-page-summary-card"><span>Source workflow</span><strong>URL publik atau asset</strong><p>Source akan diproses dulu, lalu sistem menyimpan hasil clip akhir untuk review.</p></article>
  </section>
  <div class="alert alert-info user-inline-banner">Phase 2 analysis sudah bisa mencoba impor URL publik yang didukung ke workspace media secara otomatis sebelum analisis kandidat dimulai.</div>
  <div class="form-message"></div>
  <form id="auto-clip-form" class="wizard-panel">
    <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
    <script type="application/json" id="auto-clip-presets-json"><%- JSON.stringify(clippingPresets) %></script>
    <script type="application/json" id="auto-clip-brand-kits-json"><%- JSON.stringify(brandKits) %></script>
    <div class="user-form-toolbar d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-4 gap-3">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Mode</span>
        <p class="mb-0 text-secondary">Quick Mode hanya menampilkan input penting. Advanced Mode membuka field teknis dan arahan detail untuk editor power user.</p>
      </div>
      <label class="form-check form-switch">
        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="advanced_mode">
        <span class="form-check-label">Advanced Mode</span>
      </label>
    </div>
    <section class="wizard-step"><div class="step-number">0</div><div class="step-body"><h2>Preset and brand kit</h2><p class="user-step-lead">Pilih template strategi dan visual default supaya form baru langsung terisi arah yang paling sering kamu pakai.</p><div class="row g-3">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <label class="form-label">Clipping preset</label>
        <select class="form-select" name="clipping_preset_id" data-auto-clip-preset-selector>
          <option value="">Manual defaults</option>
          <% clippingPresets.forEach((preset) => { %>
            <option value="<%= preset.id %>" <%= selectedPresetId === preset.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= preset.name %><%= preset.isDefault ? ' (default)' : '' %></option>
          <% }) %>
        </select>
        <div class="form-text">Preset akan mengisi strategi inti dan style default agar form tidak perlu diisi dari nol.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <label class="form-label">Brand kit</label>
        <select class="form-select" name="brand_kit_id" data-auto-clip-brand-kit-selector>
          <option value="">No brand kit</option>
          <% brandKits.forEach((brandKit) => { %>
            <option value="<%= brandKit.id %>" <%= selectedBrandKitId === brandKit.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= brandKit.name %><%= brandKit.isDefault ? ' (default)' : '' %></option>
          <% }) %>
        </select>
        <div class="form-text">Brand kit akan mengisi font subtitle, posisi, jumlah baris, dan safe margin.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12">
        <div class="auto-clip-preset-preview-grid">
          <article class="auto-clip-preview-card">
            <span class="eyebrow">Preset aktif</span>
            <h3 data-auto-clip-preset-name>Manual defaults</h3>
            <p data-auto-clip-preset-description>Gunakan default bawaan untuk mulai cepat, atau pilih preset agar strategi clipping langsung terisi.</p>
            <div class="auto-clip-preview-tags" data-auto-clip-preset-tags>
              <span>Platform flexible</span>
              <span>Durasi manual</span>
              <span>Hook auto</span>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="auto-clip-preview-card auto-clip-preview-card--brand">
            <span class="eyebrow">Brand kit aktif</span>
            <h3 data-auto-clip-brand-name>No brand kit</h3>
            <p data-auto-clip-brand-description>Pilih brand kit untuk subtitle style yang konsisten saat render pipeline final sudah aktif.</p>
            <div class="auto-clip-preview-tags" data-auto-clip-brand-tags>
              <span>Font default</span>
              <span>Position manual</span>
              <span>Safe margin default</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></div></section>
    <section class="wizard-step"><div class="step-number">1</div><div class="step-body"><h2>Source</h2><p class="user-step-lead">Tentukan video yang akan diproses. Pakai asset siap pakai atau URL publik yang benar-benar bisa diakses worker.</p>
      <label class="form-label">Source mode</label>
      <select class="form-select" name="source_mode">
        <option value="MEDIA_ASSET" <%= assets.length ? '' : 'disabled' %>>Uploaded media asset</option>
        <option value="EXTERNAL_URL" <%= assets.length ? '' : 'selected' %>>External source URL</option>
      </select>
      <div class="form-text">Pilih video dari asset workspace atau masukkan URL publik yang didukung. Sistem akan memproses source lalu hanya menyimpan hasil clip akhirnya.</div>

      <div class="mt-3" data-source-panel="MEDIA_ASSET" <%= assets.length ? '' : 'hidden' %>>
        <label class="form-label">Ready video asset</label>
        <select class="form-select" name="media_asset_id">
          <% if (!assets.length) { %>
            <option value="">No ready assets available</option>
          <% } %>
          <% assets.forEach((asset) => { %>
            <option value="<%= asset.id %>"><%= asset.displayName %> - <%= asset.createdAt.toLocaleString() %></option>
          <% }) %>
        </select>
        <div class="form-text">This uses a validated asset already stored in your workspace.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-3" data-source-panel="EXTERNAL_URL" <%= assets.length ? 'hidden' : '' %>>
        <label class="form-label">External source URL</label><input class="form-control" type="url" name="source_url" placeholder="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=..." <%= assets.length ? '' : 'required' %>>
        <div class="form-text">The ingestion service validates allowed domains, rejects private/reserved network destinations, lalu mencoba mengimpor source ke workspace media secara otomatis. Jika short URL seperti <code>youtu.be</code> bermasalah, pakai URL penuh <code>youtube.com/watch?v=...</code>.</div>
        <div class="form-text mt-1" data-source-url-helper>Gunakan URL publik yang benar-benar bisa diakses worker ingestion.</div>
      </div>

      <% if (!assets.length) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-warning mt-3">No ready uploaded video assets were found in this workspace yet, so external URL mode is selected by default. Source URL yang lolos validasi akan dicoba diimpor otomatis sebelum analisis dimulai.</div>
      <% } %>

      <label class="form-check mt-3"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="rights_confirmed" required><span class="form-check-label">I own or have permission to process this content.</span></label>
    </div></section>
    <section class="wizard-step"><div class="step-number">2</div><div class="step-body"><h2>Clip strategy</h2><p class="user-step-lead">Fokus ke target clip yang benar-benar penting. Opsi editorial detail tetap tersedia di panel lanjutan kalau memang dibutuhkan.</p><div class="row g-3">
      <div class="col-12">
        <div class="border rounded-4 p-3 bg-light-subtle">
          <h3 class="h5 mb-3">Konten inti</h3>
          <div class="row g-3">
            <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Judul video source</label><input class="form-control" name="title" maxlength="255" placeholder="Judul asli video atau topik episode"></div>
            <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Topik utama konten</label><input class="form-control" name="topic" maxlength="255" value="<%= formDefaults.topic %>" placeholder="Contoh: ekonomi, kesehatan, bisnis, personal finance"><div class="form-text">Ini topik utama video, bukan daftar prioritas clip.</div></div>
            <div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Platform</label><select class="form-select" name="platform"><option <%= formDefaults.platform === 'YOUTUBE_SHORTS' ? 'selected' : '' %>>YOUTUBE_SHORTS</option><option <%= formDefaults.platform === 'TIKTOK' ? 'selected' : '' %>>TIKTOK</option><option <%= formDefaults.platform === 'INSTAGRAM_REELS' ? 'selected' : '' %>>INSTAGRAM_REELS</option><option <%= formDefaults.platform === 'FACEBOOK_REELS' ? 'selected' : '' %>>FACEBOOK_REELS</option></select></div>
            <div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Objective</label><select class="form-select" name="objective"><option <%= formDefaults.objective === 'EDUCATION' ? 'selected' : '' %>>EDUCATION</option><option <%= formDefaults.objective === 'ENGAGEMENT' ? 'selected' : '' %>>ENGAGEMENT</option><option <%= formDefaults.objective === 'STORYTELLING' ? 'selected' : '' %>>STORYTELLING</option><option <%= formDefaults.objective === 'CONTROVERSY' ? 'selected' : '' %>>CONTROVERSY</option></select></div>
            <div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Primary tone</label><select class="form-select" name="primary_tone"><option <%= formDefaults.primaryTone === 'EDUCATIONAL' ? 'selected' : '' %>>EDUCATIONAL</option><option <%= formDefaults.primaryTone === 'SERIOUS' ? 'selected' : '' %>>SERIOUS</option><option <%= formDefaults.primaryTone === 'DIRECT' ? 'selected' : '' %>>DIRECT</option><option <%= formDefaults.primaryTone === 'CASUAL' ? 'selected' : '' %>>CASUAL</option><option <%= formDefaults.primaryTone === 'CONTROVERSIAL' ? 'selected' : '' %>>CONTROVERSIAL</option></select></div>
            <div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Secondary tone</label><select class="form-select" name="secondary_tone"><option value="" <%= !formDefaults.secondaryTone ? 'selected' : '' %>>None</option><option <%= formDefaults.secondaryTone === 'SERIOUS' ? 'selected' : '' %>>SERIOUS</option><option <%= formDefaults.secondaryTone === 'CASUAL' ? 'selected' : '' %>>CASUAL</option><option <%= formDefaults.secondaryTone === 'EMOTIONAL' ? 'selected' : '' %>>EMOTIONAL</option><option <%= formDefaults.secondaryTone === 'CONFIDENT' ? 'selected' : '' %>>CONFIDENT</option></select></div>
            <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Target audience</label><input class="form-control" name="target_audience" maxlength="255" value="<%= formDefaults.targetAudience %>" placeholder="Founder, mahasiswa, creator pemula, tim marketing"></div>
            <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Brief editor utama</label><textarea class="form-control" name="content_context" rows="4" maxlength="20000" placeholder="Jelaskan momen seperti apa yang harus dipilih: hook cepat, konflik, insight, payoff, dan ending yang ingin didapat."><%= formDefaults.contentContext %></textarea><div class="form-text">Kalau hanya ingin isi satu arahan utama, cukup isi field ini.</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12">
        <div class="border rounded-4 p-3">
          <h3 class="h5 mb-3">Target clip</h3>
          <div class="row g-3">
            <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Jumlah clip final</label><input class="form-control" name="clip_count" type="number" min="1" max="30" value="<%= formDefaults.clipCount %>"></div>
            <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Durasi minimum</label><input class="form-control" name="min_duration" type="number" min="10" max="180" value="<%= formDefaults.minDuration %>"></div>
            <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Durasi maksimum</label><input class="form-control" name="max_duration" type="number" min="15" max="180" value="<%= formDefaults.maxDuration %>"></div>
            <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Gaya hook</label><select class="form-select" name="hook_style"><option value="" <%= !formDefaults.hookStyle ? 'selected' : '' %>>Auto</option><option <%= formDefaults.hookStyle === 'QUESTION' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Pertanyaan</option><option <%= formDefaults.hookStyle === 'SHOCK' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Pernyataan mengejutkan</option><option <%= formDefaults.hookStyle === 'DIRECT_CHALLENGE' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Tantangan langsung</option><option <%= formDefaults.hookStyle === 'STORY_OPEN' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Pembuka cerita</option><option <%= formDefaults.hookStyle === 'MYTH_BUSTING' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Bongkar mitos</option></select></div>
            <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Arah CTA</label><select class="form-select" name="cta_preference"><option value="" <%= !formDefaults.ctaPreference ? 'selected' : '' %>>Auto</option><option <%= formDefaults.ctaPreference === 'COMMENT' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Komentar</option><option <%= formDefaults.ctaPreference === 'SHARE' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Share</option><option <%= formDefaults.ctaPreference === 'FOLLOW' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Follow</option><option <%= formDefaults.ctaPreference === 'SAVE' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Save</option></select></div>
            <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Prioritas clip mandiri</label><select class="form-select" name="standalone_priority"><option value="REQUIRED" <%= formDefaults.standalonePriority === 'REQUIRED' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Harus mandiri</option><option value="PREFERRED" <%= formDefaults.standalonePriority === 'PREFERRED' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Diutamakan mandiri</option><option value="FLEXIBLE" <%= formDefaults.standalonePriority === 'FLEXIBLE' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Fleksibel</option></select><div class="form-text">Default terbaik untuk kebanyakan kasus: <strong>Fleksibel</strong>.</div></div>
            <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-check mt-4"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="require_spoken_audio" <%= formDefaults.requireSpokenAudio ? 'checked' : '' %>><span class="form-check-label">Wajib fokus ke momen dengan suara/dialog yang jelas</span></label></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12" data-advanced-field hidden>
        <details class="border rounded-4 p-3">
          <summary class="fw-semibold">Advanced editor controls</summary>
          <p class="text-secondary small mt-2 mb-3">Bagian ini menyimpan helper packaging, daftar style, dan kontrol teknis yang lebih jarang dipakai.</p>
          <div class="row g-3">
            <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Niche</label><input class="form-control" name="niche" maxlength="120" value="<%= formDefaults.niche %>" placeholder="Marketing, finance, creator education"></div>
            <div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Bahasa source</label><input class="form-control" name="source_language" value="<%= formDefaults.sourceLanguage %>"></div>
            <div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Jumlah speaker</label><input class="form-control" name="speaker_count" type="number" min="1" max="20" value="<%= formDefaults.speakerCount %>"></div>
            <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Kata penting / custom vocabulary</label><input class="form-control" name="custom_vocabulary" value="<%= formDefaults.customVocabulary %>" placeholder="Nama brand, produk, istilah teknis"></div>
            <div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Jumlah kandidat dianalisis</label><input class="form-control" name="candidate_pool_count" type="number" min="1" max="30" value="<%= formDefaults.candidatePoolCount %>"></div>
            <div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Minimum viral score</label><input class="form-control" name="minimum_viral_score" type="number" min="0" max="10" step="0.1" value="<%= formDefaults.minimumViralScore %>"></div>
            <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Prioritas viral</label><input class="form-control" name="virality_priorities" value="<%= formDefaults.viralityPriorities %>" placeholder="hook 0-2 detik, konflik, punchline, ending komentar"><div class="form-text">Opsional. Isi hanya kalau ingin menekankan aspek viral tertentu.</div></div>
            <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Sensitive topics</label><input class="form-control" name="sensitive_topics" value="<%= formDefaults.sensitiveTopics %>" placeholder="Trauma, klaim medis, isu hukum"><div class="form-text">Pakai hanya untuk label sensitif pendek.</div></div>
            <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Topik yang ingin diprioritaskan</label><input class="form-control" name="preferred_topics" value="<%= formDefaults.preferredTopics %>" placeholder="Hook cepat, insight praktis, konflik jelas"><div class="form-text mt-1" data-list-helper="preferred_topics"></div></div>
            <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Topik yang harus dihindari</label><input class="form-control" name="topics_to_avoid" value="<%= formDefaults.topicsToAvoid %>" placeholder="SARA, klaim medis berisiko, inside joke"><div class="form-text mt-1" data-list-helper="topics_to_avoid"></div></div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <label class="form-label">Style clip</label>
              <input class="form-control" name="clip_style_tags" value="<%= formDefaults.clipStyleTags %>" placeholder="storytelling, edukasi, cinematic, shocking">
              <select class="form-select mt-2" data-append-to-field="clip_style_tags">
                <option value="">Tambah style preset...</option>
                <option value="storytelling">storytelling</option>
                <option value="educational">educational</option>
                <option value="cinematic">cinematic</option>
                <option value="shocking">shocking</option>
                <option value="podcast_insight">podcast_insight</option>
                <option value="debate">debate</option>
                <option value="commentary">commentary</option>
                <option value="case_study">case_study</option>
                <option value="quick_tips">quick_tips</option>
                <option value="emotional">emotional</option>
                <option value="direct_answer">direct_answer</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Profanity handling</label><select class="form-select" name="profanity_handling"><option <%= formDefaults.profanityHandling === 'KEEP' ? 'selected' : '' %>>KEEP</option><option <%= formDefaults.profanityHandling === 'MUTE' ? 'selected' : '' %>>MUTE</option><option <%= formDefaults.profanityHandling === 'BLEEP' ? 'selected' : '' %>>BLEEP</option><option <%= formDefaults.profanityHandling === 'SUBTITLE_CENSOR' ? 'selected' : '' %>>SUBTITLE_CENSOR</option></select></div>
            <div class="col-12"><label class="form-label">Selection brief</label><textarea class="form-control" name="selection_brief" rows="4" maxlength="12000" placeholder="Cara AI memilih kandidat clip terbaik: tipe hook, emosi, konflik, payoff, sudut narasi, atau urutan prioritas."><%= formDefaults.selectionBrief %></textarea></div>
            <div class="col-12"><label class="form-label">Avoidance brief</label><textarea class="form-control" name="avoidance_brief" rows="3" maxlength="12000" placeholder="Pola clip yang harus dihindari: intro lambat, konteks terlalu panjang, filler, jargon berat, bercanda internal, dll."><%= formDefaults.avoidanceBrief %></textarea></div>
            <div class="col-12"><label class="form-label">Packaging brief</label><textarea class="form-control" name="packaging_brief" rows="3" maxlength="12000" placeholder="Arahkan gaya title, hook text, caption, thumbnail text, hashtag, atau CTA."><%= formDefaults.packagingBrief %></textarea></div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label class="form-label">Headline angle</label>
              <select class="form-select" name="headline_angle">
                <option value="">Auto</option>
                <option value="PROBLEM_TO_CAUSE">Problem -> cause</option>
                <option value="PROBLEM_TO_SOLUTION">Problem -> solution</option>
                <option value="QUESTION_TO_ANSWER">Question -> answer</option>
                <option value="MYTH_TO_FACT">Myth -> fact</option>
                <option value="RISK_TO_WARNING">Risk -> warning</option>
                <option value="CONTRADICTION_TO_EXPLANATION">Contradiction -> explanation</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label class="form-label">Title packaging style</label>
              <select class="form-select" name="title_packaging_style">
                <option value="">Auto</option>
                <option value="SHORT_PUNCHY">Short punchy</option>
                <option value="CLEAR_EXPLANATORY">Clear explanatory</option>
                <option value="HIGH_CURIOSITY">High curiosity</option>
                <option value="RISK_FOCUSED">Risk focused</option>
                <option value="DEBATE_FOCUSED">Debate focused</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label class="form-label">Thumbnail text style</label>
              <select class="form-select" name="thumbnail_packaging_style">
                <option value="">Auto</option>
                <option value="ULTRA_SHORT">Ultra short</option>
                <option value="KEY_RISK">Key risk</option>
                <option value="KEY_QUESTION">Key question</option>
                <option value="KEY_PAYOFF">Key payoff</option>
                <option value="OBJECT_AND_CONSEQUENCE">Object and consequence</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-check mt-4"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="remove_long_silence" checked><span class="form-check-label">Remove long silence</span></label></div>
            <div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-check mt-4"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="remove_filler_words"><span class="form-check-label">Remove filler words</span></label></div>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div></div></section>
    <section class="wizard-step"><div class="step-number">3</div><div class="step-body"><h2>Visual and subtitle</h2><p class="user-step-lead">Sisakan hanya pengaturan visual yang paling memengaruhi hasil. Kontrol teknis yang jarang disentuh dipindah ke panel lanjutan.</p><div class="auto-clip-section-grid">
      <div class="auto-clip-section-card">
        <div class="auto-clip-section-card__header">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Framing</span>
            <h3>Crop dan layout video</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Bagian ini menentukan bagaimana video panjang dipotong dan diposisikan saat masuk ke canvas final.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-3">
          <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Aspect ratio</label><select class="form-select" name="aspect_ratio"><option <%= formDefaults.aspectRatio === '9:16' ? 'selected' : '' %>>9:16</option><option <%= formDefaults.aspectRatio === '1:1' ? 'selected' : '' %>>1:1</option><option <%= formDefaults.aspectRatio === '4:5' ? 'selected' : '' %>>4:5</option><option <%= formDefaults.aspectRatio === '16:9' ? 'selected' : '' %>>16:9</option></select></div>
          <div class="col-md-4" data-crop-strategy-panel><label class="form-label">Crop dan speaker</label><select class="form-select" name="crop_strategy"><option value="SMART_SPEAKER" <%= ['SMART_SPEAKER','ACTIVE_SPEAKER','SPLIT_SCREEN'].includes(formDefaults.cropStrategy) ? 'selected' : '' %>>Smart speaker - adaptif 1-4 wajah</option><option value="AUTO_REFRAME" <%= formDefaults.cropStrategy === 'AUTO_REFRAME' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Auto reframe umum</option><option value="FACE_TRACKING" <%= formDefaults.cropStrategy === 'FACE_TRACKING' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Tracking satu wajah</option><option value="CENTER" <%= formDefaults.cropStrategy === 'CENTER' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Center crop</option><option value="SPEAKER_AND_SCREEN" <%= formDefaults.cropStrategy === 'SPEAKER_AND_SCREEN' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Speaker dan screen share</option></select><div class="form-text">Satu pembicara memenuhi layar. Saat 2-4 wajah terlihat stabil, layout otomatis berubah menjadi split yang rapi tanpa menduplikasi orang yang sama.</div></div>
          <div class="col-md-6" data-layout-panel="9:16"><label class="form-label">9:16 layout template</label><select class="form-select" name="layout_template"><option value="STANDARD" <%= formDefaults.layoutTemplate === 'STANDARD' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Standard - video memenuhi canvas</option><option value="PODCAST_SPOTLIGHT_9X16" <%= formDefaults.layoutTemplate === 'PODCAST_SPOTLIGHT_9X16' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Podcast spotlight - branded frame</option></select><div class="form-text">Standard mendukung headline overlay opsional. Podcast spotlight memakai layout branding lengkap.</div></div>
          <div class="col-md-6" data-layout-panel="9:16"><label class="form-label">Branding header</label><div class="form-control bg-light d-flex align-items-center"><span><strong><%= formDefaults.channelName || 'Display name user' %></strong><%= formDefaults.channelTagline ? ` - ${formDefaults.channelTagline}` : '' %></span></div><div class="form-text">Nama dan logo header mengikuti Settings user. Label source di bagian bawah memakai nama channel YouTube dari video.</div></div>
          <div class="col-12" data-layout-panel="9:16" data-podcast-spotlight-panel>
            <div class="auto-clip-inline-options">
              <label class="form-check mb-0">
                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="podcast_source_enabled" <%= formDefaults.podcastSourceEnabled !== false ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                <span class="form-check-label">Tampilkan source channel</span>
              </label>
              <div>
                <label class="form-label" for="podcast_spotlight_style">Style Podcast Spotlight</label>
                <select class="form-select" id="podcast_spotlight_style" name="podcast_spotlight_style">
                  <option value="EDITORIAL_GOLD" <%= formDefaults.podcastSpotlightStyle !== 'VIDEO_FIRST' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Editorial Gold - headline dominan</option>
                  <option value="VIDEO_FIRST" <%= formDefaults.podcastSpotlightStyle === 'VIDEO_FIRST' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Video First - panel video lebih besar</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <p class="form-text mb-0">Source otomatis membaca nama channel YouTube. Untuk file upload, sistem memakai nama channel dari Settings sebagai fallback.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12" data-layout-panel="9:16" data-standard-headline-panel>
            <div class="auto-clip-inline-options">
              <label class="form-check mb-0">
                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="headline_overlay_enabled" <%= formDefaults.headlineOverlayEnabled !== false ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                <span class="form-check-label">Tampilkan headline pada video</span>
              </label>
              <div>
                <label class="form-label" for="headline_overlay_position">Posisi headline</label>
                <select class="form-select" id="headline_overlay_position" name="headline_overlay_position">
                  <option value="TOP" <%= formDefaults.headlineOverlayPosition === 'TOP' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Atas</option>
                  <option value="BOTTOM" <%= formDefaults.headlineOverlayPosition === 'BOTTOM' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Bawah - safe area</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <p class="form-text mb-0">Headline otomatis hanya tampil pada beberapa detik pembuka, lalu hilang agar tidak menutupi isi video. Posisi bawah tetap di atas kontrol platform.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <input type="hidden" name="split_on_multi_face" value="on">
          <div class="col-md-8"><div class="auto-clip-callout auto-clip-callout--compact"><strong>Layout adaptif otomatis</strong><span>Smart speaker memilih full-screen untuk satu wajah, split atas-bawah untuk dua wajah, dan grid maksimal empat wajah.</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="auto-clip-section-card auto-clip-section-card--soft">
        <div class="auto-clip-section-card__header">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Subtitle</span>
            <h3>Style, format, dan readability</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Pilih style yang paling cocok untuk audience kamu. Highlight per kata mengikuti style subtitle yang dipilih.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="row g-3">
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <label class="form-label">Subtitle style</label>
            <select class="form-select" name="subtitle_style">
              <option value="PODCAST_HIGHLIGHT" <%= formDefaults.subtitleStyle === 'PODCAST_HIGHLIGHT' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Highlight per kata - biru/mint (default)</option>
              <option value="DEFAULT" <%= formDefaults.subtitleStyle === 'DEFAULT' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Default clean</option>
              <option value="BOLD_KINETIC" <%= formDefaults.subtitleStyle === 'BOLD_KINETIC' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Bold kinetic</option>
              <option value="CLEAN_MINIMAL" <%= formDefaults.subtitleStyle === 'CLEAN_MINIMAL' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Clean minimal</option>
              <option value="NEWS_FLASH" <%= formDefaults.subtitleStyle === 'NEWS_FLASH' ? 'selected' : '' %>>News flash - highlight per kata</option>
              <option value="CINEMATIC_QUOTE" <%= formDefaults.subtitleStyle === 'CINEMATIC_QUOTE' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Cinematic quote</option>
            </select>
            <div class="form-text">Kata yang sedang diucapkan diberi latar gradasi biru-mint.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-3">
            <label class="form-label">Format huruf subtitle</label>
            <select class="form-select" name="subtitle_text_case">
              <option value="UPPERCASE" <%= (formDefaults.subtitleTextCase ?? 'UPPERCASE') === 'UPPERCASE' ? 'selected' : '' %>>HURUF BESAR (default)</option>
              <option value="LOWERCASE" <%= formDefaults.subtitleTextCase === 'LOWERCASE' ? 'selected' : '' %>>huruf kecil</option>
              <option value="ORIGINAL" <%= formDefaults.subtitleTextCase === 'ORIGINAL' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Sesuai transcript asli</option>
            </select>
            <div class="form-text">Berlaku untuk subtitle di video dan file subtitle hasil ekspor.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Subtitle max lines</label><input class="form-control" name="subtitle_max_lines" type="number" min="1" max="4" value="<%= formDefaults.subtitleMaxLines %>"><div class="form-text">Batas maksimum baris subtitle per cue.</div></div>
          <div class="col-md-3">
            <label class="form-label">Posisi subtitle</label>
            <select class="form-select" name="subtitle_position">
              <option value="TOP" <%= formDefaults.subtitlePosition === 'TOP' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Atas</option>
              <option value="CENTER" <%= formDefaults.subtitlePosition === 'CENTER' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Tengah</option>
              <option value="BOTTOM" <%= formDefaults.subtitlePosition === 'BOTTOM' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Bawah - safe area</option>
            </select>
            <div class="form-text">Posisi bawah diberi jarak aman, tidak menempel ke tombol player.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="row g-3">
              <div class="col-12">
                <label class="form-check mt-2">
                  <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="subtitle_enabled" <%= formDefaults.subtitleEnabled !== false ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                  <span class="form-check-label">Subtitle enabled</span>
                </label>
              </div>
              <div class="col-12">
                <label class="form-check">
                  <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="subtitle_burn_in" <%= formDefaults.subtitleBurnIn ? 'checked' : '' %>>
                  <span class="form-check-label">Burn subtitle into video</span>
                </label>
              </div>
              <div class="col-12">
                <label class="form-check">
                  <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="subtitle_profanity_censor">
                  <span class="form-check-label">Profanity censor</span>
                </label>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12" data-advanced-field hidden>
            <details class="border rounded-4 p-3">
              <summary class="fw-semibold">Advanced visual and subtitle controls</summary>
              <div class="row g-3 mt-2">
                <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Framing detection mode</label><select class="form-select" name="framing_detection_mode"><option value="COMBINED" <%= formDefaults.framingDetectionMode === 'COMBINED' ? 'selected' : '' %>>COMBINED - transcript + face detection</option><option value="TRANSCRIPT_ONLY" <%= formDefaults.framingDetectionMode === 'TRANSCRIPT_ONLY' ? 'selected' : '' %>>TRANSCRIPT_ONLY - speaker based</option><option value="FACE_DETECTION_ONLY" <%= formDefaults.framingDetectionMode === 'FACE_DETECTION_ONLY' ? 'selected' : '' %>>FACE_DETECTION_ONLY - visual face count</option></select></div>
                <input type="hidden" name="split_min_face_count" value="2">
                <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Subtitle language</label><input class="form-control" name="subtitle_language" value="<%= formDefaults.subtitleLanguage %>"></div>
                <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Primary subtitle format</label><select class="form-select" name="subtitle_primary_format"><option <%= formDefaults.subtitlePrimaryFormat === 'ASS' ? 'selected' : '' %>>ASS</option><option <%= formDefaults.subtitlePrimaryFormat === 'SRT' ? 'selected' : '' %>>SRT</option><option <%= formDefaults.subtitlePrimaryFormat === 'VTT' ? 'selected' : '' %>>VTT</option><option <%= formDefaults.subtitlePrimaryFormat === 'JSON' ? 'selected' : '' %>>JSON</option></select></div>
                <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Subtitle safe margin %</label><input class="form-control" name="subtitle_safe_margin_percent" type="number" min="0" max="30" value="<%= formDefaults.subtitleSafeMarginPercent %>"><div class="form-text">Layout Standard 9:16 memakai minimum 20% agar subtitle aman dari tombol platform.</div></div>
                <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Font</label><input class="form-control" name="subtitle_font_family" value="<%= formDefaults.subtitleFontFamily %>" placeholder="Montserrat"></div>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></div></section>
    <section class="wizard-step"><div class="step-number">4</div><div class="step-body"><h2>Review and submit</h2><p class="user-step-lead">Cek ringkasan terakhir sebelum job dibuat. Sistem akan menyimpan snapshot strategi, visual, dan subtitle agar hasilnya konsisten saat diproses.</p><div class="alert alert-light border">Submission uses an idempotency key so retries from the browser cannot create duplicate jobs.</div>
      <div class="job-summary-grid mt-3" data-auto-clip-submit-summary>
        <article class="job-summary-card">
          <span>Source</span>
          <strong data-submit-summary-source>External URL</strong>
          <p class="mb-0 mt-1 text-secondary small" data-submit-summary-source-detail>Belum ada source yang dipilih.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="job-summary-card">
          <span>Strategy</span>
          <strong data-submit-summary-strategy>YOUTUBE_SHORTS | EDUCATION</strong>
          <p class="mb-0 mt-1 text-secondary small" data-submit-summary-duration>10-45 detik - 3 clip</p>
        </article>
        <article class="job-summary-card">
          <span>Subtitle & visual</span>
          <strong data-submit-summary-subtitle>id | ASS</strong>
          <p class="mb-0 mt-1 text-secondary small" data-submit-summary-visual>9:16 - AUTO_REFRAME</p>
        </article>
        <article class="job-summary-card">
          <span>Mode</span>
          <strong data-submit-summary-mode>Quick Mode</strong>
          <p class="mb-0 mt-1 text-secondary small" data-submit-summary-rights>Rights confirmation belum dicentang.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="clip-output-warning-box mt-3" data-auto-clip-precheck>
        <strong>Pre-submit checks</strong>
        <ul class="mb-0" data-auto-clip-precheck-list>
          <li>Form akan dicek otomatis sebelum request dikirim.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-primary mt-3" type="submit">Create durable job</button>
    </div></section>
  </form>
</main></div>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
